Each record has these fields: enrol_id (text), credits (whole number), level (text), needs_lab (text), transfer_of (text), starts_on (date, YYYY-MM-DD), module (text), student (text), invoice_ref (text), list_pos (whole number), prior_level (text), tutor (text), ends_on (date, YYYY-MM-DD), course (text), lab_slot (text), grant_id (text).

Integrity rules:
R1. Each `transfer_of` that is given must match the `enrol_id` of a preceding record of the batch.
