R3. A combination of `student` and `module` that turns up in two records is not allowed, although each of the two fields may repeat by itself.
R4. `tutor` must be a key of the reference list `tutors` whose status there is "current".
R5. No value of `level` other than "intro", "capstone", "advanced" is accepted.
R6. The reference list `courses` must contain every value of `course`.
R7. `credits` stays within 3 to 10, limits included.
R8. The values of `list_pos` are consecutive in batch order: no number is skipped or repeated, wherever the count starts.

